meta {
  name: End Geo Exception
  type: http
  seq: 39
}

patch {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/hr/geo-exceptions/{{geoExceptionId}}
  body: json
  auth: none
}

headers {
  Cookie: auth_token={{authToken}}
}

body:json {
  {
    "effective_to": "2026-01-15"
  }
}

docs {
  Ends an exception by setting its end date, never by deleting it - the punches
  already made under it must keep pointing at a row that explains them.

  exception_type is not accepted here: changing the kind would rewrite the
  recorded reason for those punches. End this one and add another instead.
}
